     A*****************************************************************
     A* SHN Provider/Contract Exception File - This file will house   *
     A* all records sent from Synergy, where a provider record was    *
     A* unable to be written or updated.  The manual match-up process *
     A* will use this file.  Data errors do not get written to this   *
     A* file                                                          *
     A*                                                               *
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Created on 04/28/2003 by c:62 for Project 10MBX               *
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Revisions:                                                    *
     A*                                                               *
     A* 07/06/04 c:62 Project 10MDT                                   *
     A*               -Add Network Type flag                          *
     A*               -Add Status                                     *
     A*                                                               *
     A* 06/13/03 c:62 Project 10MBX                                   *
     A*               Add contract state                              *
     A*                                                               *
     A*****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(FSREFP)
     A          R PSE01                     TEXT('Prov/Contract Exeption File')
     A            SEFEIN         9A         TEXT('FEIN')
     A            SEID#         11A         TEXT('ID Number')
     A            SENAME        60A         TEXT('Physician Name')
     A            SEFSN         30A         TEXT('Phys First Name')
     A            SESPDS        50A         TEXT('Specialty Description')
     A            SEMAD1        40A         TEXT('Mailing Address 1')
     A            SEMAD2        40A         TEXT('Mailing Address 2')
     A            SEMCTY        30A         TEXT('Mailing City')
     A            SEMST          2A         TEXT('Mailing City')
     A            SEMZIP        10A         TEXT('Mailing Zip')
     A            SEBAD1        40A         TEXT('Billing Address 1')
     A            SEBAD2        40A         TEXT('Billing Address 2')
     A            SEBCTY        30A         TEXT('Billing City')
     A            SEBST          2A         TEXT('Billing State')
     A            SEBZIP        10A         TEXT('Billing Zip')
     A            SEPHN#        10A         TEXT('Office Number')
     A*** BEGIN ADD *** 06/13/03 **************************************
     A            SECST          2A         TEXT('Contract State')
     A*** END   ADD *** 06/13/03 **************************************
     A            SEGSEQ        15P 0       TEXT('Generic Sequence #')
     A            SEIUSR    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial User')
     A            SEIPGM    R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial Program')
     A            SEITIM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial Time')
     A            SEIDT     R               REFFLD(DT7)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial Date')
     A*** BEGIN ADD *** 07/06/04 **************************************
     A            SENTYP         1A         TEXT('Network Type')
     A*
     A*           Valid values:
     A*              "C" = % of Charge
     A*              " " = % of MRA
     A*
     A            SESTAT         1A         TEXT('Status')
     A*
     A*           Valid values:
     A*              "D" = Deleted
     A*              " " = Not Deleted
     A*
     A*** END   ADD *** 07/06/04 **************************************
